# Leste applications in the MeeGo session's application grid.
# Every Leste application a menu would show is in the grid by itself; one
# desktop id per line (from /usr/share/applications or its hildon/
# directory) adjusts that: "-id" leaves an application out, "id" adds one
# that has no menu entry of its own.

# The Maemo 5 ports are meant for Leste's own desktop; MeeGo has its own
# applications for these (or Harmattan versions of them)
-gpodder-leste
-petrovich
-yappari
-fahrplan2
